  "body": "If a srcdoc document contains a meta element with a referrer policy, we\nshould use that as the document's referrer policy instead of walking up\nthe tree to find the first non-srcdoc document's referrer policy.\n\n(As discussed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1559#issuecomment-251767893)\n",
